  "_what": "The exact stdout shape `claude -p --output-format json` produces, so the adapter can be tested against the real envelope with no model call.",
  "_why": "GOV-R2-01: parse_verdict read the model's JSON at the ROOT of stdout. The CLI does not put it there — it prints its own result envelope and puts the model's text in `result`, as a STRING. Every adapter test supplied a bare object, so the suite agreed with the code and both were wrong about the only thing that would have run in production.",
